WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,220
Do you understand what I said yesterday?

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:06,620
I still find it ugly to seek refuge with a man.

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,020
Is life more important or face more important?

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,820
Zhang Feifei at least won't let me starve to death

5
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,620
Zhang Feifei can't even control the fire now

6
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:12,620
Your foot hurt today

7
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,020
Can you still go out to find food tomorrow?

8
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,820
Xue Ya will stop scolding you because you are a singer.

9
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,020
You have millions of fans

10
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:18,620
But fans can’t give me a sip of water now

11
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:20,020
Either find a way out in advance

12
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,370
Or wait for others to decide your life or death

13
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:23,370
can you help me

14
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:24,770
I have already contacted Su Ce

15
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:25,970
What he wants is value

16
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:27,170
Not your previous fame

17
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:28,370
So what do I have to pay?

18
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:29,770
Start with work first

19
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:31,770
Can you stay and see yourself?

20
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,660
I'll go if you hear it

21
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:41,860
There's one more thing I've agreed on beforehand

22
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,660
After you go there, don’t wait for others to make you famous

23
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,460
Don’t trade celebrity status for preferential treatment either.

24
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,460
I know Su Ce is annoyed by this the most.

25
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:48,660
If you can't do it, just say so.

26
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:49,660
Just do it if you can

27
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,660
What you need most now is to let him know

28
00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:56,220
You are not a burden that can only sing. I can learn from you.

29
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:58,420
At least it won’t be worse than being scolded by Xue Ya every day
